<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 02:05:52 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“一个大问题”：特朗普交易的股票比所有国会议员的总和还多。布什时代的道德律师解释了为什么你应该担心</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/trump-trades-congress-index-fund-ethics/</link><description>白宫表示，总统的 28,700 笔交易都是自动化且无需干预的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1250536011-e1789756525956.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/trump-trades-congress-index-fund-ethics/</guid></item><item><title>Dollar General首席执行官表示，随着高油价和通货膨胀重塑消费者的习惯，年收入10万美元的消费者不再感觉自己是高收入购物者</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/dollar-general-high-income-shoppers-100000-high-gas-prices-inflation/</link><description>“拥有 2,000 件 1 美元或以下的商品对消费者来说非常有意义，一直如此，但尤其是在这种环境下。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1827147740-e1789940537780.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 23:03:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/dollar-general-high-income-shoppers-100000-high-gas-prices-inflation/</guid></item><item><title>加拿大和法国正在谈判深化关系并“按照我们选择的方式生活”，而马克龙也在伊朗战争中断供应之际寻求石油和天然气</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/canada-france-economic-ties-carney-macron-oil-gas-supplies-iran-war/</link><description>加拿大总理马克·卡尼和法国总统埃马纽埃尔·马克龙周日同意深化太空、国防、能源和商业领域的合作。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295738682-e1789936044538.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 20:39:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/canada-france-economic-ties-carney-macron-oil-gas-supplies-iran-war/</guid></item><item><title>伊朗经济面临另一次封锁：繁文缛节和僵局堵塞了绕开美国海军霍尔木兹海峡的陆路路线</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/iran-economy-blockade-gridlock-land-routes-trucking-us-navy-hormuz/</link><description>“在这种情况下，除了找到恢复和维持南部贸易走廊的方法外，别无选择。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2291433469-e1789852332342.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 20:13:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/iran-economy-blockade-gridlock-land-routes-trucking-us-navy-hormuz/</guid></item><item><title>一位 71 岁的老人以放射科医生和教授的身份退休，现在经营着一家香蕉串生意：“我从来都不想退休。你为什么要这么做？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/retired-professor-radiologist-richard-brown-turning-to-entreprenuership-career-success-starting-over-poka-snack/</link><description>理查德·布朗的职业生涯把他从考场带到了教室和董事会。 71 岁了，他仍在工作，现在专注于创业。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RichardBrown.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 09:34:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/retired-professor-radiologist-richard-brown-turning-to-entreprenuership-career-success-starting-over-poka-snack/</guid></item><item><title>美国经济达到关键里程碑：数据中心和其他信息处理硬件的支出现已超过住房投资</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/us-economy-milestone-spending-data-centers-ai-boom-housing-residential-investment/</link><description>“我们看到美国经济发生了关键转变：投资正在从住宅投资转向计算机投资。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2113285194-e1789920827317.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 18:04:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/us-economy-milestone-spending-data-centers-ai-boom-housing-residential-investment/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能代理正在同意并采取行动：机器现在比人类更聪明。他们的校长只是同意</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/ai-agents-machines-smarter-than-humans-regulation/</link><description>人工智能界的大佬们都同意前沿必须有节奏，但他们没有动力束缚自己的手脚。其他人则这样做。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2261854815-e1789918678852.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 15:56:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/ai-agents-machines-smarter-than-humans-regulation/</guid></item><item><title>中美美食外交：尽管政治紧张，两国快餐连锁店在对方领土上受欢迎</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/us-china-gastrodiplomacy-political-tension-fast-food-chains-popularity-mixue-mcdonalds/</link><description>Mixue 是全球最大的快餐连锁店之一，拥有超过 53,000 家门店，于 12 月在美国开设了前三家门店。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26260649027058-e1789916857675.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 15:19:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/us-china-gastrodiplomacy-political-tension-fast-food-chains-popularity-mixue-mcdonalds/</guid></item><item><title>经济经历了结构转型，结束了低成本时代。 “通货膨胀和利率的政权更迭就是结果”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/us-economy-structural-transformation-low-cost-era-regime-change-inflation-interest-rates/</link><description>从很多方面来说，这种转变使经济回到了 2007 年 12 月金融危机爆发之前的水平，这场危机一直持续到 2009 年 6 月。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26259683175570-e1789915881338.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 14:59:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/us-economy-structural-transformation-low-cost-era-regime-change-inflation-interest-rates/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普表示，他将把计划中的拱门改造成“顶级军事综合体”，可以容纳无人机、狙击手和弹药</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/trump-arch-military-complex-drones-snipers-ammunition/</link><description>特朗普在社交媒体帖子中表示，应军方的“强烈要求”，他同意对拱门进行改造。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26240737448587-e1789914971759.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 14:43:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/trump-arch-military-complex-drones-snipers-ammunition/</guid></item></channel></rss>